TopIdxModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Returns the idx field of the top stack frame (node index in the current block). Parser stack utility.
    Provides: TopIdx(stack) -> idx.
    DependsOn: none (leaf with no dependencies on other modules)
